{
  "_meta": {
    "description": "Map from ECG classifier SCP-ECG codes (English) to Chinese guideline-retrieval terms + a coarse guideline topic. Bridges the cross-lingual gap: the classifier emits EN codes, the corpus is CN, so raw codes give zero BM25 match. CN terms drive retrieval; `topic` is metadata aligned to corpus/manifest.json topics.",
    "owner": "code->topic + clinical mapping is human-owned; cn synonym lists may be expanded offline (DeepSeek) then curated. Never invent Class/LOE here.",
    "conventions": "topic=null => not guideline-actionable (normal / nonspecific morphology / pacemaker already present) => contributes no query. Codes map to the 6 current corpus topics only.",
    "known_limits": "MI-location codes (AMI/IMI/...) are often OLD/chronic MI in PTB-XL but the only ischemia_stemi corpus record is ACUTE STEMI reperfusion; acute-vs-chronic distinction is a corpus refinement (M1).",
    "corpus_topics": [
      "atrial_fibrillation",
      "bradycardia_conduction",
      "ventricular_arrhythmia",
      "qt_channelopathy",
      "ischemia_stemi",
      "svt",
      "electrolyte",
      "hypertrophy_cardiomyopathy"
    ],
    "synonyms_note": "CN synonyms expanded via DeepSeek (deepseek-v4-pro) + human curation, 2026-06-05. v0.2: +室性心律失常/肥厚型心肌病 topics, remapped PVC/早搏/肥厚类 codes (2026-06-05)."
  },
